scn 1
# Head-on at scale: two opposing formations of 200 (enemy players, sight 4096 so
# each sees the other) cross in a 98-cell corridor (z 42-139). Group awareness
# should have them plan round each other as wholes. Sibling of aware-headon at
# 8x the size (plan 3.8 'densehead').
name densehead
ticks 4000
seed 7
players 2
team 0 0
team 1 1
map flat 260 180
wall 0 40 260 2
wall 0 140 260 2
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
group A 0 m 200 rect 10 60 40 120 pitch=3
group B 1 m 200 rect 220 60 250 120 pitch=3
at 1 move A 235 90
at 1 move B 25 90
gate mid 130 42 130 139
line farA 200 0 200 180
line farB 60 0 60 180
region goalA 215 60 255 120
region goalB 5 60 45 120
